OgBe Meji
@_0gbe

Subdivision is a generative art piece with 64 unique editions, exploring the beauty of structured randomness through recursive division. This artwork transforms simple forms into intricate, mesmerizing compositions—an algorithmic dance of geometry in constant evolution.

This artwork requires processing power and is intended for laptops and desktops primarily.

@gpitombo - March 2025

cross-chain X is the first ever implementation of the collection on both chains: ordinals and ethereum;

your goal is to combine ordinal with eth nfts to reach the rarest combination;

to lock pieces with each other, your nft on eth will go through different phases and will change traits;
